<title>USA: Commerce Capital wins Atlantic City, N.J., BANs.</title>
<headline>Commerce Capital wins Atlantic City, N.J., BANs.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Commerce Capital Association said on Wednesday that it won $30 million of Atlantic City, N.J., bond anticipation notes (BANs).</p>
<p>The net interest cost was 3.7456 percent.</p>
<p>The coupon was 4.25 percent.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
